GAME DATA

The files data/pt/, data/en/ and data/es/ (words.txt, secrets.txt and vectors.bin) are data, distributed alongside the code and not under the GPL. They are adapted from the FastText word vectors trained on Common Crawl and Wikipedia:

- FastText crawl vectors, https://fasttext.cc/docs/en/crawl-vectors.html, by Facebook AI Research (Meta), licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share-Alike License 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/.
- E. Grave, P. Bojanowski, P. Gupta, A. Joulin, T. Mikolov, "Learning Word Vectors for 157 Languages", Proceedings of LREC 2018.

Changes made by this project: only the first 400,000 words of each file were used; the vocabulary was filtered by dictionaries and lists of offensive words and capped at 50,000 words; the vectors were normalized, reduced by principal component analysis to 100 or 150 dimensions in the smaller packages, and stored with 1 byte per number. The secret words were selected and reviewed by this project. These adapted files are distributed under the same CC BY-SA 3.0 license.

Used only to filter words during generation, and not distributed: fserb/pt-br (https://github.com/fserb/pt-br, MIT License, Copyright 2021 Fernando Serboncini), wooorm/dictionaries (Hunspell base forms, https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries) and LDNOOBW's list of offensive words (CC BY 4.0).
